    "updated_at": "2022-11-24T15:27:13Z",
    "body": "I'm not sure this is something that makes sense for this specification. How logged messages are displayed to the user is up to the user agent, and the user agent may be displaying, storing, or transmitting messages to multiple sinks at the same time.",
